=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\nDejaVuSans-Bold;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\nmso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; word-break: keep-all;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; word-break: keep-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:red;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">Submission\nDeadline</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">: Dec 13<sup>th</sup>, 2019 (Overdue application will be\nrejected)<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; word-break: keep-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:red;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">Submission\naddress</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; word-break: keep-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">1.\nOnline application: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font